  "habitsTitle": "Tsika dzakakodzera kutaurwa",
  "habitsIntro": "Tsika idzi dzinoenderana nenjodzi yakaderera yedementia pakati pemapoka makuru evanhu. Hadzisi chitsidzo kumunhu mumwe chete. Hapana tsika, mutambo kana kudya kwakaratidzwa kudzivirira dementia.",
  "habitsHearingVisionTitle": "Kuongororwa kwekunzwa nekuona",
  "habitsHearingVisionBody": "Kusanzwa zvakanaka nekusaona zvakanaka zvisina kurapwa zvose zvinoenderana nenjodzi yakakwira yedementia. Kuongororwa kunokurumidza, uye kurapa chero chimwe chacho kunogona kuita kuti hupenyu hwezuva nezuva huve nyore, zvisinei nemhedzisiro padementia.",
  "habitsHeartTitle": "Kumanikidzwa kweropa nekolesterolo",
  "habitsHeartBody": "Kumanikidzwa kweropa kwakakwira nekolesterolo yakakwira pakati pehupenyu zvinoenderana nenjodzi yakakwira yedementia. Chiremba anogona kuongorora zvose uye kutaura zvinokukodzera.",
  "habitsMoveTitle": "Famba nemuviri wako",
  "habitsMoveBody": "Kushanda kwemuviri kunoenderana nenjodzi yakaderera yedementia uye kunobatsira hutano nenzira dzimwe. Sarudza chimwe chaunofarira uye chaunogona kuramba uchiita, uye bvunza chiremba kutanga kana usina chokwadi.",
  "habitsConnectTitle": "Gara uchisangana nevanhu",
  "habitsConnectBody": "Kusurukirwa kwevanhu kunoenderana nenjodzi yakakwira yedementia. Nguva yenguva dzose nevamwe, mhuri kana boka inofanira kuiswa nzvimbo.",
  "habitsSmokeTitle": "Kuputa fodya nedoro",
  "habitsSmokeBody": "Kuputa fodya nekunwa doro zvakanyanya zvinoenderana nenjodzi yakakwira yedementia. Kana uchida kudzora kana kurega, chiremba kana sevhisi yepanzvimbo inogona kubatsira.",
  "habitsHeadTitle": "Dzivirira musoro wako",
  "habitsHeadBody": "Kukuvara kwemusoro kunoenderana nenjodzi yakakwira yedementia. Herimeti yekutasva bhasikoro nekuchenjerera pazvikwerere nemumotokari ndedzimwe nhanho dzakareruka.",
  "habitsDoctorNote": "Hapana chezvi chinotsiva mazano echiremba. Kana uchinetseka nezvekurangarira kana nezvedementia, taura nechiremba.",
  "habitsSourcesTitle": "Zvinobva kupi",
